WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:02.960
- [Instructor] So right
over here, I have a flower

00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:05.090
and I have a ruler

00:00:05.090 --> 00:00:09.860
and what I wanna do is figure
out how wide this flower is.

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:11.110
So you can pause the video

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:13.193
and think about how I would do that.

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:16.760
All right, now let's do this together.

00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:19.410
So if I wanna figure out
how wide the flower is,

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:20.365
first I could say, all right,

00:00:20.365 --> 00:00:23.480
the left side of the
flower goes about this far.

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:26.220
So let me draw a line here just
so we can really keep track

00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:27.670
of how far we go to the left

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:32.240
and then the right side of the
flower goes about that far.

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:33.830
So let's keep track of that

00:00:33.830 --> 00:00:37.820
and then we can use our
ruler to measure the distance

00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:39.513
between those two lines.

00:00:40.641 --> 00:00:42.110
We can rotate it a little bit

00:00:43.630 --> 00:00:45.940
then I'm going to move it a little bit

00:00:47.030 --> 00:00:49.670
and I want the left edge of the ruler

00:00:49.670 --> 00:00:51.610
to start at that left line.

00:00:51.610 --> 00:00:55.460
So starting right over
here and then we could see

00:00:55.460 --> 00:00:58.570
that it's one, two, three inches roughly

00:00:58.570 --> 00:01:00.580
to get us to the right side.

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:03.910
So it looks like this
flower right over here

00:01:03.910 --> 00:01:07.960
is three inches wide.

